    leaveText:["Continue keeps the exact current loop. Returning to Stage ends this attempt.","繼續會保留目前完整狀態；返回 Stage 才會結束本次挑戰。","继续会保留当前完整状态；返回 Stage 才会结束本次挑战。","続行なら現在の状態を保持し、ステージへ戻ると挑戦を終了します。","계속하면 현재 상태를 유지하고 Stage로 돌아가면 도전이 끝납니다.","Continuar conserva el estado exacto. Volver a Stage termina el intento.","Continuar mantém o estado exato. Voltar ao Stage encerra a tentativa.","Continuer garde l'état exact. Revenir au Stage termine la tentative.","Fortsetzen behält den Zustand. Zurück zur Stage beendet den Versuch.","Continua mantiene lo stato. Tornare allo Stage termina il tentativo.","Продолжение сохраняет состояние. Возврат на Stage завершает попытку."],
